      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:1855_U.S._Coast_Survey_Chart_or_Map_of_the_Savanna_River,_Georgia_-_Geographicus_-_SavannahRiver-uscs-1855.jpg",
